[B]Features[/B]
- Based on Linux 2.6.32.9 Source
- Overclock - to 1200MHz 
- Underclock - to 19 Mhz
- 748MHz Undervolt
- Frandom - Entropy Generator
- Swap support 
- Tun support
- More coming soon, real soon!

[B]Coming soon[/B]
- Stock ROM support
- frontswap, dynamic fsync
- cpu alignment
- You tell me 

[B]Governors[/B]
- smartassv2
- interactive
- conservative
- ondemand
- performance
- intelliactive
- ondemandx

